|| גיל , less often || שִׂישׂ עָלַז, רָנַן, , etc.; — 1 in common life: a. rejoice , with ב person or of thing take pleasure in Judg 9:19 (twice in verse); Deut 33:18 ; Eccl 3:22 7 t. + (probably) בְּכָליָֿמֵינוּ Psa 90:14 (others ב temporal), compare Eccl 11:8 ; עַל person Isa 39:2 + || 2Kin 20:13 ( וישׂמח for וישׁמע ᵑ0 Vrss modern), עַל of thing Jonah 4:6 ; 2Chr 15:15 ; with temporal clause Jer 41:13 6 t. + (of heart) Prov 23:15 , in one's heart Exod 4:14 (J); with כִּי because Isa 14:29 3 t.; with אֵת with 66:10 ; with מִן person get pleasure from Prov 5:18 ; absolute 1Sam 11:9 ; Eccl 3:12 ; Prov 13:9 (figurative of prosperity; subject אוֺר ; opposed to דָּעַךְ ), + 8 t.; with ל of thing at Job 21:12 . b. rejoice arrogantly, exult at, ל person, Micah 7:8 ; Isa 14:8 ; Obadiah 12; Psa 35:19 ; 35:24 ; 38:17 , with אֶלֿ of thing Ezek 25:6 , ב of thing Job 31:29 ; Psa 35:15 ; Prov 24:17 ; absolute Hosea 9:1 (+ אֶלגִּֿיל ), 2Sam 1:20 3 t., + (said of righteous by Eliphaz) Job 22:19 . 2. a. rejoice religiously, with ב of thing 1Sam 2:1 ; Deut 12:7 ; Psa 21:2 7 t.; with ׳בי , etc., Joel 2:23 ; Psa 32:11 10 t. Psalms + 9:3 (+ בָ֑ךְ אֶעֶלְצָה ); with עַל of thing 2Chr 29:36 , עַל infinitive 1Chr 29:9 a; with לְמַעַן of thing Psa 48:12 ; with כִּי because 119:74 ; absolute Zechariah 2:14; Zech 4:10 ; Joel 2:21 ; 1Chr 29:9 b (with accusative of congnate meaning with verb), 16:31 (of heavens) = Psa 96:11 ; 97:1 (isles) + 18 t. (12 t. Psalms), + (of heart) Zech 10:7 a Psa 16:9 ; 1Chr 16:10 , בְּכָללֵֿב Zeph 3:14 (compare Exod 4:14 1a above); with י ׳לִפְנֵי Isa 9:2 and (of joyous feasting etc., at sanctuary) Lev 23:40 (H), Deut 12:12 , 18 ; 16:11 ; 27:7 , compare 14:26 ; 1Sam 11:15 . b. subject ׳י , with עַל person Isa 9:16 (|| רחם ; Perles RÉJ xxxiv. 63 be Gentle , Arabic ), ב of thing Psa 104:31 . Pi`el Perfect 3masculine singular וְשִׂמַּח consecutive Deut 24:5 , suffix שִׁמְּחָהוּ Jer 20:15 , etc.; Imperfect 3masculine singular יְשַׂמַּח Psa 104:15 +, etc.; Imperative masculine s